WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.514
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.515 --> 00:00:15.085
I'm a cottontail rabbit.

3
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:21.235
Cottontails are mammals with long ears.

4
00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:24.165
Where do you live?

5
00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:29.749
Cottontails live in North and South America.

6
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:35.933
We like open fields and meadows.

7
00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:39.119
What do you eat?

8
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:44.547
Cottontails mostly eat grasses and herbs.

9
00:00:44.548 --> 00:00:51.627
We love vegetables like lettuce and peas!

10
00:00:51.628 --> 00:00:54.679
When do you eat?

11
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:59.889
We eat after the sun goes down.

12
00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:06.172
That keeps us safe from enemies.

13
00:01:06.173 --> 00:01:10.603
Do you have many enemies?

14
00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:16.702
Yes, cottontails have a lot of enemies!

15
00:01:16.703 --> 00:01:22.813
Owls, hawks, and foxes often hunt us.

16
00:01:22.814 --> 00:01:30.002
But we can run away very fast!

17
00:01:30.003 --> 00:01:37.475
Your tail is so cute!

18
00:01:37.476 --> 00:01:42.292
Cottontails have brown or gray fur.

19
00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:47.961
But we all have the same kind of tail.

20
00:01:47.962 --> 00:01:55.994
It looks like a white cotton ball!

21
00:01:55.995 --> 00:02:00.589
Are those your babies?

22
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:06.340
Yes. We make shallow nests underground.

23
00:02:06.341 --> 00:02:12.201
Our babies are very tiny when they're born.

24
00:02:12.202 --> 00:02:20.691
Many babies do not survive.

25
00:02:20.692 --> 00:02:24.871
I'm going back into the nest now.

26
00:02:24.872 --> 00:02:30.331
Good-bye!

27
00:02:30.332 --> 00:02:36.623
Bye, Cottontail Rabbit!

